### Repro steps.
Create a module and export the same module in the export tag (this is the fault)
```
@NgModule({
  imports: [CommonModule],
  exports: [ MyFaultyModule ],
  declarations: [MyFaultyComponent],
  providers: [],
})
export class MyFaultyModule { }
```
Build a production build:
ng build --prod

### The log given by the failure.
ERROR in RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded
    at StaticReflector.annotations (PathRemovedForDemo\node_modules\@angular\compiler\bundles\compiler.umd.js:1:1)
    at NgModuleResolver.resolve (PathRemovedForDemo\node_modules\@angular\compiler\bundles\compiler.umd.js:14750:70)
    at CompileMetadataResolver.getNgModuleMetadata (PathRemovedForDemo\node_modules\@angular\compiler\bundles\compiler.umd.js:15402:60)
    at CompileMetadataResolver.getNgModuleSummary (PathRemovedForDemo\node_modules\@angular\compiler\bundles\compiler.umd.js:15358:52)
